        "PMC6908586::web::015::thermal_stability_and_applicability_to_n",
        "PMC8779564::web::002::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Diffusion and dissolution or dealloying processes typically drive corrosion degradation of Q235 steel under both ambient and high-temperature conditions.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "HEA-coated and annealed Q235 steel will show less mass loss than uncoated Q235 steel under identical exposure.",
